Subject: Re: [r-inla] Binomial model with offset
Message-ID: <B5iUOizRHmI.Fub1KT_-AQAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <B5iUOizRHmI.u6e7tU8GDAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
References: <B5iUOizRHmI.u6e7tU8GDAAJ@r-inla-discussion-group.groups.google.com>
