Hi,

I got the below error message when trying to install INLA (stable or testing) on R 3.6.0.

Error in slibs[are_shared] : invalid subscript type 'list'

I solved it by adding

StagedInstall: no

into the DESCRIPTION file (following [1] and [2]).

gg

[1]https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/issues/46
[2]https://github.com/x13org/x13binary/pull/47/commits/c718d92356462334c615a40386dfab688ad1db07

